    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but doesn't that mean the art itself is kind of losing its objective worth? if the goal is just to send a message, it feels like the skill and the actual visual experience are being treated as secondary or even irrelevant. it seems like a decline in quality overall.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
